  "mach:judgement": "Adopt",
  "mach:judgementReason": "The gold-standard biomedical literature index — 35M+ citations, MeSH controlled vocabulary, free E-utilities API, maintained by NLM/NCBI. The primary source for verifying and discovering peer-reviewed papers associated with clinical tools, AI models, and healthcare software. MeSH terms enable clinical precision that general academic indexes lack. PMC provides open-access full text for 4M+ articles. Adopt as the primary paper verification source for any system cataloging biomedical research software — use alongside OpenAlex (which adds citation graph, ROR affiliations, and funder metadata that PubMed does not provide).",
